# =============================================================================
# US Tow AI-Connect — root env template
# =============================================================================
# The API and web app each maintain their own .env file. This root template
# only exists to point you at them.
#
#   packages/api/.env.example   -> copy to packages/api/.env
#   packages/web/.env.example   -> copy to packages/web/.env
#
# For the production deployment, every variable is set in Railway directly
# (per-service), NOT in any committed file. See docs/DEPLOY_RAILWAY.md.
# =============================================================================
